     "d": "<ul><li>Infectious (TORCH, hepatitis virus, <b>bacterial sepsis*, UTI*</b>)</li><li>Genetic (<b>Cystic fibrosis*</b>, Alagille Syndrome)</li><li>Metabolic (Inborn errors of metabolism, alpha-1-antitrypsin deficiency)</li><li>Endocrine (Hypothyroid, hypopituitarism)</li><li>Iatrogenic (TPN, other drugs)</li><li>Neoplastic (hepatoblastoma)</li></ul>"
